APRStac is a free, closed-source APRS web client, digipeater, and IGate by KN4MKB / ModernHam.

It is distributed under a custom proprietary license.
For terms of use, features, and official support, please refer to:
- Official website: https://aprstac.com/
- Support and Community: https://themodernham.com/
- Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/cw/modernham
